  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"><b><a href=\"https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/Phase-change-and-heat/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/Phase-change-and-heat/</a></b><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">학생</span></span> 데이타는 쌓이지 않게 되어 있어요.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"상태변화와 열의 출입 퀴즈 | 중학교 1학년 과학\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"hyoseonoh5.github.io\" data-og-source-url=\"https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/Phase-change-and-heat/\" data-og-url=\"https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/Phase-change-and-heat/\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/Phase-change-and-heat/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://hyoseonoh5.github.io/Phase-change-and-heat/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">상태변화와 열의 출입 퀴즈 | 중학교 1학년 과학</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">hyoseonoh5.github.io</p></div></a></div><p>저희 학교도 곧 수업을 해야하고 저는 애들 데이터를 보기를 원해서요.^^;;</p><p>앱 컨셉은 스파이더맨인데... 사실 저작권 문제로 타이즈 입은 아이와 네드, MJ와 함께하는 상태변화와 열 퀴즈앱입니다.</p><p>1,2 단계로 이루어져 있어요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1단계 (열을 흡수하는, 열을 방출하는 변화, 그래프 두 가지 문제)</p><p>2단계 데스매치(19개 상황에서 상태변화명, 열출입, 주변 온도변화를 묻는 문항)으로 구성했어요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1단계에서 12점 획득 2단계에서 19점을 모두 획득하면 명예의 전당 카드가 나오는 그런 컨셉입니다. (카드를 샘께 보여드리라고 했어요. )</p><p>&#160;</p><p>앱 버전과, 개발자 문의, 앱카드 발동 등 다른 선생님들의 개발 모습에서 흉내 내었습니다. ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"floatLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d81c2f9e4fb0b3980a106849cfccbcb7d233260\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"330\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d81c2f9e4fb0b3980a106849cfccbcb7d233260\" data-origin-width=\"907\" data-origin-height=\"541\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c12d0376b842580b16e2699bd95c9d97a1d5cad3\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"412\" height=\"470\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c12d0376b842580b16e2699bd95c9d97a1d5cad3\" data-origin-width=\"797\" data-origin-height=\"909\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/275a79bb6f82e2c18d28b5553bcfeb4be17e3208\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"493\" height=\"223\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/275a79bb6f82e2c18d28b5553bcfeb4be17e3208\" data-origin-width=\"736\" data-origin-height=\"333\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b3bc4b3b5181b4d2e3d2d6bcc5c91f0ea8a3211\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"428\" height=\"507\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b3bc4b3b5181b4d2e3d2d6bcc5c91f0ea8a3211\" data-origin-width=\"695\" data-origin-height=\"824\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba92c54fd23b570582a91b4b77b021da0d8e6181\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba92c54fd23b570582a91b4b77b021da0d8e6181\" data-origin-width=\"549\" data-origin-height=\"684\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a3555cc4b5f824fc62075b21fa0865034ac3531\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a3555cc4b5f824fc62075b21fa0865034ac3531\" data-origin-width=\"570\" data-origin-height=\"365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7de5c114a08c08e24e651fcb4b60e4573e3771d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7de5c114a08c08e24e651fcb4b60e4573e3771d\" data-origin-width=\"568\" data-origin-height=\"675\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8ad030ac438138edc4cbf9275a92b77400ee9878\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8ad030ac438138edc4cbf9275a92b77400ee9878\" data-origin-width=\"421\" data-origin-height=\"743\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
